  "theorem": "There exists a complex projective K3 surface X with generic NS(X)=U+E8(-1)+D6(-1) and an effective C4 x C2 automorphism group.  A purely non-symplectic order-four element sigma=s*g acts on Picard as Kondo's tau_2.  Its fixed section of the complete 19-wall nef chamber is the finite-volume noncompact H14/17 Vinberg Coxeter polytope."
